                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Definition</run>
                <run bold='true'>: Percentage of payment that are successfully processed</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#787878'>Total payments:</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b'><![CDATA[ <[federated.1bxj1hr0xzzc4s13tpsyz19h6yvo].[sum:Calculation_1898267280945385474:qk]>]]></run>
