                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>ACCR =  Accepted payments / Total payments</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>ACCR = SCCR with single attempt + SCCR with multiple attempts + Recovery rate</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
